    "sub_name": "遙測學",
    "sub_ename": "REMOTE SENSING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程主要介紹遙感探測和航空攝影測量之基本原理、作業程序以及儀器的構造，同時也敘述測量製圖與三維模型建置自動化之概念。",
    "describe_eh": " Theories, procedures, and instruments for Remote Sensing and Photogrammetry are presented in this course. Furtermore, topics of surveying mapping and automatic 3D modeling will be also included.",
